{"id":"vod_sn_53779","vodId":"53779","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"进击的巨人","name_cn":"进击的巨人","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"HD","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20231101-1/aadb2f78cb9c2273a281ca54e3997c05.jpg"},"summary":"曾几何时，世界上突然出现无数身形庞大的巨人，普通人类的生命受到前所未有的威胁。为了保护自身安全，最后的人类筑起三座高墙：玛莉亚、露丝和希娜。人类迎来了长达一个世纪的和平岁月，却也让自己成为圈养在笼中的鸟儿，屈辱地失去自由。845年，高达60米的超大型巨人和铠之巨人登场， 摧毁了最外层的玛莉亚之壁，也惊醒了人类似乎永远不会苏醒的长梦。在此事件中，不愿蜷缩在墙内的少年艾伦·耶格尔（梶裕贵 配音）亲眼目睹母亲遇害，由此更坚定了他加入调查兵团的决心。在此之后，艾伦和青梅竹马三笠·阿克曼（石川由依 配音）、好友阿尔敏·亚鲁雷特（井上麻里奈 配音）加入第104期训练兵团，发誓成为足以消灭所有巨人的英勇战士。百年的和平结束，人类和巨人的战争再度拉开序幕……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-11-01 16:47:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/k3G9xHFpUY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/FaviaNPpV41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/7RrKueQ0kx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/j62LZMrrv81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/mKW5Nbm6eW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/n5bCvZVPDu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/ZRVcE84e3v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/L9ZbXWTmn31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/sFT2g4RWwt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/xmjgxXwWx31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/baajnnRysa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/4gnQWdfrzr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/5XLbmFBBUD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202310/31/2rgHi5Q